                        <h3>Custom Apex Development – Beyond Point‑and‑Click</h3>
                        <p>While Salesforce’s declarative tools (Process Builder, Flow) handle simple automation, complex business logic requires Apex. We write efficient, well‑tested Apex code to handle everything from intricate validation rules to multi‑system orchestration. Our triggers are bulk‑safe and designed to scale with your data volume.</p>

                        <h3>Lightning Web Components for Modern UI</h3>
                        <p>User adoption hinges on interface experience. We build Lightning Web Components (LWC) that are fast, reusable, and tailored to your users’ needs. Whether it’s a custom dashboard, a guided selling tool, or a complex data entry form, our LWCs make working in Salesforce a pleasure.</p>

                        <h3>Seamless Integrations with Your Tech Stack</h3>
                        <p>Your business runs on more than just Salesforce. We connect Salesforce to your ERP (SAP, Oracle), marketing automation (HubSpot, Marketo), e‑commerce platforms, and custom‑built applications using REST/SOAP APIs. The result? A unified view of your customers and operations.</p>

                        <h3>Data Migration That Doesn’t Break the Bank</h3>
                        <p>Moving data from legacy systems can be a nightmare. We use a combination of Data Loader, ETL tools (like MuleSoft), and custom scripts to ensure data integrity, deduplication, and a smooth cutover. Your users won’t even notice the switch.</p>

                        <h3>Ongoing Performance Optimization</h3>
                        <p>Even well‑built systems can slow down over time. We regularly audit your Salesforce instance for inefficient queries, unindexed fields, and technical debt. We then optimize code and configurations to keep your instance running lightning fast.</p>

